---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - FPL Manager Watch">
  <Nav />

  <main class="page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Last updated: 2026-02-28</p>
    </header>

    <section class="card">
      <div class="card-body">
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how FPL Manager Watch collects, uses, and protects your information. Transparency is important to me, so I want to be clear about exactly how your data is handled.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information Collected</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Account information:</strong> Your email address and secure password when you sign up or log in.</li>
          <li><strong>FPL Data:</strong> Basic usage data needed to operate the service, which consists of your publicly available Fantasy Premier League (FPL) data.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How Information is Used</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To provide secure login and account management features.</li>
          <li>To fetch, analyze, and display your FPL manager statistics.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. How Data is Stored and Processed</h2>
        <p>To run this site securely and efficiently, I use trusted third-party services:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Supabase:</strong> Used as the database and authentication provider. Your account details and saved FPL preferences are stored securely on their servers.</li>
          <li><strong>Cloudflare:</strong> Used for website hosting, routing, and security.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses strictly necessary local storage and cookies to keep you logged in via Supabase Authentication. No third-party tracking or advertising cookies are used.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Your Data Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to access, update, or delete your personal information at any time. If you wish to delete your account and entirely remove your data from the database, please contact me.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions, feedback, or data requests, please contact me at <a href="mailto:contact@fplmanagerwatch.com">contact@fplmanagerwatch.com</a> and I will do my best to reply.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
